              "explanation": "Hardwired execution time = 4 cycles * 1.2 ns = 4.8 ns. Microprogrammed execution time = 3 microinstructions * 3.5 ns = 10.5 ns. Speedup of hardwired = 10.5 / 4.8 = 2.19x faster.",
